(4482267, 645551, 3214, '<td valign="top">Way nice, like that you can see the centerline disappearing into the horizon, the curve adds a ton of interest. Love the almost monotone look, too.</td>', 'Way nice, like that you can see the centerline disappearing into the horizon, the curve adds a ton of interest. Love the almost monotone look, too.', '2008-02-13 01:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482273, 646253, 3214, '<td valign="top">Sweet, and well done, wish I could see detail in her legs, but yeah, I know, basic editing.</td>', 'Sweet, and well done, wish I could see detail in her legs, but yeah, I know, basic editing.', '2008-02-13 01:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482275, 646468, 3214, '<td valign="top">Fun! and well done.</td>', 'Fun! and well done.', '2008-02-13 02:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482286, 646193, 89940, '<td valign="top">Is it really panning if you aren''t moving the camera? :)<br/>Nice photo, cute girl. I really like the positioning in the frame even though she is moving out of the frame she is facing inward and I think that works very well. I would like to see a little more light on her face but realize that would be hard to do.</td>', 'Is it really panning if you aren''t moving the camera? :)Nice photo, cute girl. I really like the positioning in the frame even though she is moving out of the frame she is facing inward and I think that works very well. I would like to see a little more light on her face but realize that would be hard to do.', '2008-02-13 02:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482299, 646253, 89940, '<td valign="top">My initial reaction was something didn''t look right in this photo. The background seems to be moving up/down not side-to-side. Also the ground is in focus which looks unnatural</td>', 'My initial reaction was something didn''t look right in this photo. The background seems to be moving up/down not side-to-side. Also the ground is in focus which looks unnatural', '2008-02-13 02:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482302, 645551, 89940, '<td valign="top">I would never have thought of panning by keeping the camera stationary and moving the surroundings. Nice color and I like the framing using the car. There is a sense of speed but the blurring isn''t as pronounced as I would like. My initial reaction was that the wall was just out of focus.</td>', 'I would never have thought of panning by keeping the camera stationary and moving the surroundings. Nice color and I like the framing using the car. There is a sense of speed but the blurring isn''t as pronounced as I would like. My initial reaction was that the wall was just out of focus.', '2008-02-13 02:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482303, 646459, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice color. Really like how sharp the wing is but think it would be a better photo if the head were more in focus.</td>', 'Nice color. Really like how sharp the wing is but think it would be a better photo if the head were more in focus.', '2008-02-13 02:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482308, 645806, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice pan, I like how sharp the car is. Would like it better if the car was a little further to the left of the photo so it had more room to drive into the photo.</td>', 'Nice pan, I like how sharp the car is. Would like it better if the car was a little further to the left of the photo so it had more room to drive into the photo.', '2008-02-13 02:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482310, 644628, 89940, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t work for me as an example of panning because it just looks like you used a shallow DOF to blur the background. Would be better if there was a little more apparent motion in the subject.</td>', 'This doesn''t work for me as an example of panning because it just looks like you used a shallow DOF to blur the background. Would be better if there was a little more apparent motion in the subject.', '2008-02-13 02:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482315, 644660, 89940, '<td valign="top">Like how sharp the boy''s face is. Panning really conveys motion. I like the positioning so there is room for him to move into the photo. My initial reaction was that he was moving backwards, and after looking more closely I decided that I couldn''t tell. I think the pole of the swing really detracts from an otherwise well done photo.</td>', 'Like how sharp the boy''s face is. Panning really conveys motion. I like the positioning so there is room for him to move into the photo. My initial reaction was that he was moving backwards, and after looking more closely I decided that I couldn''t tell. I think the pole of the swing really detracts from an otherwise well done photo.', '2008-02-13 02:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482321, 645817, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice color and lighting, The panning doesn''t really convey motion to me, it just looks like a photo taken with a shallow DOF. You can tell that there was some lateral movement but it''s not pronounced enough</td>', 'Nice color and lighting, The panning doesn''t really convey motion to me, it just looks like a photo taken with a shallow DOF. You can tell that there was some lateral movement but it''s not pronounced enough', '2008-02-13 02:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482323, 646329, 89940, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and love how sharp the airplane is. Very well done</td>', 'Very nice color and love how sharp the airplane is. Very well done', '2008-02-13 02:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482325, 646177, 88148, '<td valign="top">the letters are distracting, otherwise awesome.</td>', 'the letters are distracting, otherwise awesome.', '2008-02-13 02:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482327, 644363, 89940, '<td valign="top">Great photo, really conveys speed. I like that her face is sharp, that she has room to move into the photograph and the yellow sign adds a nice splash of color. Well done.</td>', 'Great photo, really conveys speed. I like that her face is sharp, that she has room to move into the photograph and the yellow sign adds a nice splash of color. Well done.', '2008-02-13 02:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482330, 646148, 89940, '<td valign="top">Certainly conveys motion but would be so much better if the body of the bird was in focus. My initial thought was that this looks like a failed attempt at panning.</td>', 'Certainly conveys motion but would be so much better if the body of the bird was in focus. My initial thought was that this looks like a failed attempt at panning.', '2008-02-13 02:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482332, 645919, 89940, '<td valign="top">What a strange and unique effect. The background definitely conveys motion. Would like to see the guy in green a walking into the photo as opposed to out of it. Still can''t figure out what the purple lines are and why they are at knee level.</td>', 'What a strange and unique effect. The background definitely conveys motion. Would like to see the guy in green a walking into the photo as opposed to out of it. Still can''t figure out what the purple lines are and why they are at knee level.', '2008-02-13 02:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482338, 646423, 89940, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t convey motion to me. My initial thought was that he is stopped and you took the photo with a shallow DOF. Like the colors, it''s good photo, but not so much if you are trying to show panning.</td>', 'Doesn''t convey motion to me. My initial thought was that he is stopped and you took the photo with a shallow DOF. Like the colors, it''s good photo, but not so much if you are trying to show panning.', '2008-02-13 02:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482369, 646325, 79955, '<td valign="top">Nice capture on getting the subject sharp while panning.However the snowy backgound does not emphasize your panning efforts</td>', 'Nice capture on getting the subject sharp while panning.However the snowy backgound does not emphasize your panning efforts', '2008-02-13 02:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
