(4483533, 646441, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the toning here.  It seems to fit with the neighborhood.  the white snow is somewhat distracting, as is the bright streetlight.  but nice job stopping the motion of the cab.</td>', 'I like the use of the toning here.  It seems to fit with the neighborhood.  the white snow is somewhat distracting, as is the bright streetlight.  but nice job stopping the motion of the cab.', '2008-02-13 13:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
