(4483537, 646439, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice processing,  I like the warmth.  not sure about the frame, but I usually don''t knock people except if the frame is obnoxious (this one isn''t!)</td>', 'nice processing,  I like the warmth.  not sure about the frame, but I usually don''t knock people except if the frame is obnoxious (this one isn''t!)', '2008-02-13 13:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
