(4483543, 646458, 66193, '<td valign="top">without the title this one would have had me scratching my head.  the abstract nature is intriguing, as is the overhead POV.  luckily, I''m in the camp where everything doesn''t need to be tack sharp. I like this one.</td>', 'without the title this one would have had me scratching my head.  the abstract nature is intriguing, as is the overhead POV.  luckily, I''m in the camp where everything doesn''t need to be tack sharp. I like this one.', '2008-02-13 13:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
