(4483547, 645672, 66193, '<td valign="top">i remember liking another shot like this in the last Motion Panning challenge.  Very nice colors, and very nice technique.  this one works well for me.</td>', 'i remember liking another shot like this in the last Motion Panning challenge.  Very nice colors, and very nice technique.  this one works well for me.', '2008-02-13 13:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
