(4483552, 644340, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this one, and you''ve effectively use the technique.  but then again, this just could be stop photography.  too bad about the very bright white lights, as they are distracting.  the girl has a very nice smile, and she certainly seems to be having fun!</td>', 'I like the colors in this one, and you''ve effectively use the technique.  but then again, this just could be stop photography.  too bad about the very bright white lights, as they are distracting.  the girl has a very nice smile, and she certainly seems to be having fun!', '2008-02-13 13:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483555, 646232, 66193, '<td valign="top">very nice framing, and the white car and line work very well against the grey background.  very obviously used panning here, and this shot took some skill!</td>', 'very nice framing, and the white car and line work very well against the grey background.  very obviously used panning here, and this shot took some skill!', '2008-02-13 13:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483556, 644558, 66193, '<td valign="top">the use of panning is not obvious to me here.</td>', 'the use of panning is not obvious to me here.', '2008-02-13 13:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483559, 645906, 66193, '<td valign="top">at first I thought that you just kept your hand still while the victim moved.  but  i can see now that you indeed moved the camera while taking the shot.  creative POV.</td>', 'at first I thought that you just kept your hand still while the victim moved.  but  i can see now that you indeed moved the camera while taking the shot.  creative POV.', '2008-02-13 13:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483564, 645835, 66193, '<td valign="top">to me, having the camera and the subject stationary on a rotating platform doesn''t constitute panning in my book.  would''ve been cool for the eye challenge, though.  the background is nicely complementary to the main subject.</td>', 'to me, having the camera and the subject stationary on a rotating platform doesn''t constitute panning in my book.  would''ve been cool for the eye challenge, though.  the background is nicely complementary to the main subject.', '2008-02-13 13:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483641, 645811, 54878, '<td valign="top">Ooo, an 08 675 and in the best colour too, we''ve not had any in Neon Blue at work yet which is a shame as it really is eye candy.  As for the photo, the sharpness of the bike is good and the background blur excellent.  However, I feel that a tighter crop to loose some of the space above, below and behind would of improved it.</td>', 'Ooo, an 08 675 and in the best colour too, we''ve not had any in Neon Blue at work yet which is a shame as it really is eye candy.  As for the photo, the sharpness of the bike is good and the background blur excellent.  However, I feel that a tighter crop to loose some of the space above, below and behind would of improved it.', '2008-02-13 14:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483650, 646480, 66193, '<td valign="top">looks like panning, so you go that going for it.  looks somewhat tilted, but could be due to snow bank.  the subject is not very exciting.</td>', 'looks like panning, so you go that going for it.  looks somewhat tilted, but could be due to snow bank.  the subject is not very exciting.', '2008-02-13 14:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
