(4483658, 643637, 66193, '<td valign="top">if this record were spinning, then your camera would need to be moving into the frame to capture it this way.  have a suspicion that you might have even put the camera on top of the vinyl.  not a very exciting subject, though.  I didn''t know that Barry manilow wrote a song for Donna Summer.</td>', 'if this record were spinning, then your camera would need to be moving into the frame to capture it this way.  have a suspicion that you might have even put the camera on top of the vinyl.  not a very exciting subject, though.  I didn''t know that Barry manilow wrote a song for Donna Summer.', '2008-02-13 14:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483661, 646485, 66193, '<td valign="top">great colors and composition.  I really get the sense of movement here.  great capture.</td>', 'great colors and composition.  I really get the sense of movement here.  great capture.', '2008-02-13 14:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483664, 646329, 66193, '<td valign="top">looks a touch oversaturated.  nice panning though, and I can feel the movement of the plane. very nice.</td>', 'looks a touch oversaturated.  nice panning though, and I can feel the movement of the plane. very nice.', '2008-02-13 14:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
