(4485958, 646429, 81382, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the face is not sharp and there is no other non-blurred focal point. Could have been great, nice colours, well composed, just lacking the sharpness</td>', 'Unfortunately, the face is not sharp and there is no other non-blurred focal point. Could have been great, nice colours, well composed, just lacking the sharpness', '2008-02-14 08:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
