(4485972, 646439, 81382, '<td valign="top">Well done on getting at least one headlight sharp (the eyes of a car portrait). Not sure if I like the tones though, very bright and very dark and not much detail inbetween</td>', 'Well done on getting at least one headlight sharp (the eyes of a car portrait). Not sure if I like the tones though, very bright and very dark and not much detail inbetween', '2008-02-14 08:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
