(4485987, 646356, 81382, '<td valign="top">If only the head and eyes were sharp rater than the neck. Having commented on some of these now, sharpness on the the subject and prime focal point is everything</td>', 'If only the head and eyes were sharp rater than the neck. Having commented on some of these now, sharpness on the the subject and prime focal point is everything', '2008-02-14 08:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485991, 646025, 81382, '<td valign="top">Well captured, sharpness that is lacking is so many other entries is great here, although the upper leg is sharper than the head which is a slight downer.... can''t have it all I suppose</td>', 'Well captured, sharpness that is lacking is so many other entries is great here, although the upper leg is sharper than the head which is a slight downer.... can''t have it all I suppose', '2008-02-14 08:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485996, 645778, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness on the face. The only other thing to mention really is the tonal range, could have pushed the bottom end a bit harder to increase contrast as the scene is a little grey and washed out. A bit more saturation to bring out the yellow and green would have strengthened the subject against a fairly neutral background</td>', 'Great sharpness on the face. The only other thing to mention really is the tonal range, could have pushed the bottom end a bit harder to increase contrast as the scene is a little grey and washed out. A bit more saturation to bring out the yellow and green would have strengthened the subject against a fairly neutral background', '2008-02-14 08:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485998, 644401, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness. Composition wise, its a shame that the subject is divided by the horizon</td>', 'Great sharpness. Composition wise, its a shame that the subject is divided by the horizon', '2008-02-14 08:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486000, 646010, 88352, '<td valign="top">Even though the rest of the bodies aren''t in focus, the face of the back tiger is, and that makes this photo FANTASTIC to me.  If the whole tiger was in focus, I don''t think it would have been as interesting to me.  The crop also is great for this.</td>', 'Even though the rest of the bodies aren''t in focus, the face of the back tiger is, and that makes this photo FANTASTIC to me.  If the whole tiger was in focus, I don''t think it would have been as interesting to me.  The crop also is great for this.', '2008-02-14 08:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486002, 643268, 81382, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, nice and sharp were it should be, well done</td>', 'Interesting subject, nice and sharp were it should be, well done', '2008-02-14 08:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
