(4486224, 644791, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice capture of the pelican.  the bright spots detract a little in the background.  the colors of the rest of the bg are nice.</td>', 'nice capture of the pelican.  the bright spots detract a little in the background.  the colors of the rest of the bg are nice.', '2008-02-14 11:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486225, 645856, 66193, '<td valign="top">good job stopping the cycle.  a little shadows/highlights might have helped bring out some more details in the bike itself.  yellow flowers in the bg give it a nice sense of motion</td>', 'good job stopping the cycle.  a little shadows/highlights might have helped bring out some more details in the bike itself.  yellow flowers in the bg give it a nice sense of motion', '2008-02-14 11:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486232, 645710, 66193, '<td valign="top">I think the camera''s shutter speed hurt you here.  a longer shutter speed would have given more background blur, but also makes it harder to keep the subject in focus.</td>', 'I think the camera''s shutter speed hurt you here.  a longer shutter speed would have given more background blur, but also makes it harder to keep the subject in focus.', '2008-02-14 11:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486236, 645551, 66193, '<td valign="top">I know there is a lot of discussion about what consititutes panning, but in my mind, this isn''t it.  the camera is stationary in the car, and what I see is just motion blur.  a pretty good photo, however, just doesn''t fit challenge as well.</td>', 'I know there is a lot of discussion about what consititutes panning, but in my mind, this isn''t it.  the camera is stationary in the car, and what I see is just motion blur.  a pretty good photo, however, just doesn''t fit challenge as well.', '2008-02-14 11:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486239, 646345, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice selection of shutter speed, and good job capturing the goose.</td>', 'nice selection of shutter speed, and good job capturing the goose.', '2008-02-14 11:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486240, 646129, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice capture!  good detail in the shadow areas of the quad.</td>', 'nice capture!  good detail in the shadow areas of the quad.', '2008-02-14 11:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486244, 645700, 66193, '<td valign="top">spinning around in the chair?  to me this is not panning.  some may disagree with that, but I expect a little more in this challenge other than fixing the camera relative to the subject.</td>', 'spinning around in the chair?  to me this is not panning.  some may disagree with that, but I expect a little more in this challenge other than fixing the camera relative to the subject.', '2008-02-14 11:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486247, 645375, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice colors here.  good panning technique, and selection of shutter speed.</td>', 'nice colors here.  good panning technique, and selection of shutter speed.', '2008-02-14 11:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486249, 646124, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice colors, and technique. border is a little too much, though.</td>', 'nice colors, and technique. border is a little too much, though.', '2008-02-14 11:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486253, 645445, 66193, '<td valign="top">to me, this challenge was about conveying the sense of motion.  you''ve succeeded in capturing the birds, but I don''t feel any motion at all.  capturing a background where the motion was evident would''ve helped.</td>', 'to me, this challenge was about conveying the sense of motion.  you''ve succeeded in capturing the birds, but I don''t feel any motion at all.  capturing a background where the motion was evident would''ve helped.', '2008-02-14 11:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486257, 643615, 66193, '<td valign="top">kind of static composition, with the bird right in the dead center.  placing the bird in the right side of the frame, so that it was flying into the shot would have added some interest.</td>', 'kind of static composition, with the bird right in the dead center.  placing the bird in the right side of the frame, so that it was flying into the shot would have added some interest.', '2008-02-14 11:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486264, 645817, 66193, '<td valign="top">next time, try shooting either early or late in the day.  that way, the light will give a much more pleasing look to the photo.</td>', 'next time, try shooting either early or late in the day.  that way, the light will give a much more pleasing look to the photo.', '2008-02-14 11:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486267, 643921, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice capture with the reflection.  shutter speed might have been a touch too fast (easier to get the bird sharp, but doesn''t give as much a sense of motion with blurred background)</td>', 'nice capture with the reflection.  shutter speed might have been a touch too fast (easier to get the bird sharp, but doesn''t give as much a sense of motion with blurred background)', '2008-02-14 11:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486270, 645617, 66193, '<td valign="top">good capture and the horse is quite sharp!  nice colors, too</td>', 'good capture and the horse is quite sharp!  nice colors, too', '2008-02-14 11:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486274, 646414, 66193, '<td valign="top">white balance is off here, and having everything blurry doesn''t work for me.  the setting for the shot (in a school hallway?) doesn''t add anything either.</td>', 'white balance is off here, and having everything blurry doesn''t work for me.  the setting for the shot (in a school hallway?) doesn''t add anything either.', '2008-02-14 11:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486277, 646429, 66193, '<td valign="top">I give you credit for attempting the shot with such a long shutter speed.  gives a wonderful sense of motion, and the shot is nicely composed.</td>', 'I give you credit for attempting the shot with such a long shutter speed.  gives a wonderful sense of motion, and the shot is nicely composed.', '2008-02-14 11:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486279, 646284, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice duotone, and I love the kid''s expression.  certainly adds to the emotion in the photo.</td>', 'nice duotone, and I love the kid''s expression.  certainly adds to the emotion in the photo.', '2008-02-14 11:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
