(4486673, 646291, 66193, '<td valign="top">seems to have a blue cast.  the capture of the subject is good.</td>', 'seems to have a blue cast.  the capture of the subject is good.', '2008-02-14 13:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486676, 645491, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice warm feel to this.  effective use of panning</td>', 'nice warm feel to this.  effective use of panning', '2008-02-14 13:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486682, 645994, 66193, '<td valign="top">quick comment about the border (didn''t affect score). when you have a lot of white in the shot, use a black stroke to separate from border.  as for the pic itself, the dogs and musher are kind of small.  There appear to be blown out spots in the snow, which is hard to control admittedly.  Cool subject for the challenge.</td>', 'quick comment about the border (didn''t affect score). when you have a lot of white in the shot, use a black stroke to separate from border.  as for the pic itself, the dogs and musher are kind of small.  There appear to be blown out spots in the snow, which is hard to control admittedly.  Cool subject for the challenge.', '2008-02-14 13:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486684, 646423, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice composition and colors.  tough to see how the panning enhances the shot however.</td>', 'nice composition and colors.  tough to see how the panning enhances the shot however.', '2008-02-14 13:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486686, 644014, 66193, '<td valign="top">would have worked better had the cyclist been coming at you.  looks like a good use of panning, though</td>', 'would have worked better had the cyclist been coming at you.  looks like a good use of panning, though', '2008-02-14 13:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486688, 645919, 66193, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to figure out what that purple is.  and I''m trying out how to do this within basic rules.  ignoring that, the purple and yellow do complement each other.  overall, though, the shot just doesn''t appeal to me (just a reaction, I know, not a critique).</td>', 'I''m trying to figure out what that purple is.  and I''m trying out how to do this within basic rules.  ignoring that, the purple and yellow do complement each other.  overall, though, the shot just doesn''t appeal to me (just a reaction, I know, not a critique).', '2008-02-14 13:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486690, 646405, 66193, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred a looser crop here.  good use of panning.</td>', 'I would have preferred a looser crop here.  good use of panning.', '2008-02-14 13:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486692, 644443, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice use of panning, and good selection of shutter speed.  very well done.</td>', 'nice use of panning, and good selection of shutter speed.  very well done.', '2008-02-14 13:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486696, 645427, 66193, '<td valign="top">very abstract.  this one is not my cup of team, however.  I don''t care for the brightness of it.  the colors are pleasant enough. seems too heavy on the left, though.</td>', 'very abstract.  this one is not my cup of team, however.  I don''t care for the brightness of it.  the colors are pleasant enough. seems too heavy on the left, though.', '2008-02-14 13:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486698, 645926, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice use of panning and good title</td>', 'nice use of panning and good title', '2008-02-14 14:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486699, 645751, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice shot of the cyclist.  would have been great without the car behind him.  good selection of shutter speed.</td>', 'nice shot of the cyclist.  would have been great without the car behind him.  good selection of shutter speed.', '2008-02-14 14:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486700, 645437, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice title. good use of panning.</td>', 'nice title. good use of panning.', '2008-02-14 14:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486702, 644741, 66193, '<td valign="top">tough time coming up with a subject, huh?  certainly unique!</td>', 'tough time coming up with a subject, huh?  certainly unique!', '2008-02-14 14:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486706, 646347, 66193, '<td valign="top">blues look way overdone here.  white balance also looks off, and very noisy.  gyms are very hard to shoot in!  appears to be pretty good use of panning, although it is very busy.</td>', 'blues look way overdone here.  white balance also looks off, and very noisy.  gyms are very hard to shoot in!  appears to be pretty good use of panning, although it is very busy.', '2008-02-14 14:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486711, 646148, 66193, '<td valign="top">definitely panning.  Looks pretty noisy, and would have been better if we could see the bird''s head.  shutter speed selection looks good.</td>', 'definitely panning.  Looks pretty noisy, and would have been better if we could see the bird''s head.  shutter speed selection looks good.', '2008-02-14 14:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486712, 646348, 66193, '<td valign="top">not sure how this is panning, and is a very boring subject.</td>', 'not sure how this is panning, and is a very boring subject.', '2008-02-14 14:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486716, 645845, 66193, '<td valign="top">very nice use of panning, and you shot it in good light too.</td>', 'very nice use of panning, and you shot it in good light too.', '2008-02-14 14:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486718, 646253, 66193, '<td valign="top">very good panning here.  the lights are a little distracting, but I also like how she is looking at the camera.</td>', 'very good panning here.  the lights are a little distracting, but I also like how she is looking at the camera.', '2008-02-14 14:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486719, 646193, 66193, '<td valign="top">very nice kid pic!</td>', 'very nice kid pic!', '2008-02-14 14:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486722, 646040, 66193, '<td valign="top">very nice shot of the bird.  I think the shutter speed was too short, and takes away any sense of motion.  would have been higher score, with the longer exposure time (higher degree of difficulty)</td>', 'very nice shot of the bird.  I think the shutter speed was too short, and takes away any sense of motion.  would have been higher score, with the longer exposure time (higher degree of difficulty)', '2008-02-14 14:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486725, 646276, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in the background.  I have no idea what the subject is however, and don''t see how the panning contributes to the photo.</td>', 'I like the colors in the background.  I have no idea what the subject is however, and don''t see how the panning contributes to the photo.', '2008-02-14 14:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486728, 643812, 66193, '<td valign="top">creative subject.  i like how the candle flame adds to the sense of movement.  Not sure I like the red and green background however.  it clashes with the warm feeling evoked by the candle.</td>', 'creative subject.  i like how the candle flame adds to the sense of movement.  Not sure I like the red and green background however.  it clashes with the warm feeling evoked by the candle.', '2008-02-14 14:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486730, 644463, 66193, '<td valign="top">pretty cool subject.  I do get a sense of movement here.</td>', 'pretty cool subject.  I do get a sense of movement here.', '2008-02-14 14:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486731, 643995, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like how it''s all out of focus here.  adds to the sense of movement.</td>', 'I like how it''s all out of focus here.  adds to the sense of movement.', '2008-02-14 14:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486733, 644089, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice idea about catching the car mid-puddle.  framing is a little awkward</td>', 'nice idea about catching the car mid-puddle.  framing is a little awkward', '2008-02-14 14:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486735, 645724, 66193, '<td valign="top">say what?  I''ll have to look that one up.  nice panning here.  would have been great just a split second later where its wings were in a lighter area of the frame.</td>', 'say what?  I''ll have to look that one up.  nice panning here.  would have been great just a split second later where its wings were in a lighter area of the frame.', '2008-02-14 14:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486736, 643642, 66193, '<td valign="top">not panning at all.</td>', 'not panning at all.', '2008-02-14 14:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486737, 646032, 66193, '<td valign="top">looks a little washed out.  nice use of panning.  blown out sky is a little distracting.</td>', 'looks a little washed out.  nice use of panning.  blown out sky is a little distracting.', '2008-02-14 14:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486741, 646145, 66193, '<td valign="top">not sure how panning was used here.  looks like either the camera was stationary the subject moved around, or vice versa.  cool metallic look, and I like the abstract nature nonetheless.</td>', 'not sure how panning was used here.  looks like either the camera was stationary the subject moved around, or vice versa.  cool metallic look, and I like the abstract nature nonetheless.', '2008-02-14 14:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486746, 644303, 66193, '<td valign="top">now that looks like fun.  effective use of panning to give sense of motion.  colors might be a touch oversaturated.  I don''t like the border much.</td>', 'now that looks like fun.  effective use of panning to give sense of motion.  colors might be a touch oversaturated.  I don''t like the border much.', '2008-02-14 14:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486749, 646267, 66193, '<td valign="top">definitely get the sense of motion here.  I love the expression on her face.</td>', 'definitely get the sense of motion here.  I love the expression on her face.', '2008-02-14 14:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486750, 644356, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice movement here.  And he does look determined.  great composition</td>', 'nice movement here.  And he does look determined.  great composition', '2008-02-14 14:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
