(4488881, 645724, 83080, '<td valign="top">Good sharpness of the subject.  The wing blends with the background in a strange way and the whites are a bit hot.  Overall, very good panning motion.</td>', 'Good sharpness of the subject.  The wing blends with the background in a strange way and the whites are a bit hot.  Overall, very good panning motion.', '2008-02-15 13:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4488884, 646182, 83080, '<td valign="top">The whites in the background are a little distracting.  I love the color of the bird and you kept it relatively sharp.  Nice job.</td>', 'The whites in the background are a little distracting.  I love the color of the bird and you kept it relatively sharp.  Nice job.', '2008-02-15 13:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4488885, 643921, 83080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors &amp; reflection.  Too bad the head is not a little more sharp, but that''s panning.</td>', 'Beautiful colors & reflection.  Too bad the head is not a little more sharp, but that''s panning.', '2008-02-15 13:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4488909, 645919, 83080, '<td valign="top">I''m honestly a bit confused on this one.  The motion is clear, but the man''s shadow is extremely strange and I can only guess at what''s producing the purple light.  Those are some very long lines of motion.<br/> <br/>The overall composition is very interesting.  I like the repeating patterns and the yellows in the upper third contrasting the bottom 2/3.  Fascinating picture.  I look forward to seeing more about this one, but I''m going to keep coming back to see if I have an a-ha moment about the elements involved here.</td>', 'I''m honestly a bit confused on this one.  The motion is clear, but the man''s shadow is extremely strange and I can only guess at what''s producing the purple light.  Those are some very long lines of motion. The overall composition is very interesting.  I like the repeating patterns and the yellows in the upper third contrasting the bottom 2/3.  Fascinating picture.  I look forward to seeing more about this one, but I''m going to keep coming back to see if I have an a-ha moment about the elements involved here.', '2008-02-15 14:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4488917, 646405, 83080, '<td valign="top">Good job keeping the subject sharp.  I would probably like the tilt more on this one if it weren''t for the trees in the background giving me an off balance feel.  Overall nice shot.</td>', 'Good job keeping the subject sharp.  I would probably like the tilt more on this one if it weren''t for the trees in the background giving me an off balance feel.  Overall nice shot.', '2008-02-15 14:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
