(4488934, 646356, 83080, '<td valign="top">You should do a variation on this one for the "Peace" challenge.  Beautiful effect.  I''m curious to see what settings you used.  It''s too bad that the sharpest are is on the neck rather than the head, but that''s what makes pnning difficult I suppose.</td>', 'You should do a variation on this one for the "Peace" challenge.  Beautiful effect.  I''m curious to see what settings you used.  It''s too bad that the sharpest are is on the neck rather than the head, but that''s what makes pnning difficult I suppose.', '2008-02-15 14:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4488937, 646459, 83080, '<td valign="top">Cool bird.  Nice job tracking with it and getting some great motion blur.  It''s too bad that the sharpness of the body  (which is fantastic) does not extend to the head.</td>', 'Cool bird.  Nice job tracking with it and getting some great motion blur.  It''s too bad that the sharpness of the body  (which is fantastic) does not extend to the head.', '2008-02-15 14:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
