(4488948, 646220, 83080, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting abstract concept.  The lower right light is a bit distracting for me.  Overall it''s a bit dark for my taste.  Nice job following the birds, particularly since it looks like you used a longer shutter than most.</td>', 'This is an interesting abstract concept.  The lower right light is a bit distracting for me.  Overall it''s a bit dark for my taste.  Nice job following the birds, particularly since it looks like you used a longer shutter than most.', '2008-02-15 14:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
