(4489453, 644382, 86848, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, although I think a slightly longer shutter speed would have done better justice in adding motion.</td>', 'Not a bad shot, although I think a slightly longer shutter speed would have done better justice in adding motion.', '2008-02-15 18:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489456, 646414, 88580, '<td valign="top"><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-03 18:49:10.</i></td>', '', '2008-02-15 18:49:07.000000', '2008-03-03 18:49:10.000000', 1),
(4489457, 646325, 86848, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  Definately shows some action.  Sky and snow are blown out though, taking a bit from the motion and dynamics of the shot.</td>', 'Great capture!  Definately shows some action.  Sky and snow are blown out though, taking a bit from the motion and dynamics of the shot.', '2008-02-15 18:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489458, 645919, 88580, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Surreal.</td>', 'Very cool.  Surreal.', '2008-02-15 18:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489461, 646131, 86848, '<td valign="top">Wow, was the car rolling slowly for the shot?  I would imagine it would be pretty hard to get a good pan half way down the track.</td>', 'Wow, was the car rolling slowly for the shot?  I would imagine it would be pretty hard to get a good pan half way down the track.', '2008-02-15 18:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489469, 644628, 86848, '<td valign="top">Great focus, but keeping the shutter open a little longer might give more sense of motion.  Good shot.</td>', 'Great focus, but keeping the shutter open a little longer might give more sense of motion.  Good shot.', '2008-02-15 18:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489475, 643268, 86848, '<td valign="top">Wow, thats strikes me as being a bit busy.  I struggle determining where the subject really is.  The cart, or the man on the bike?  To me, they both compete for the scene.</td>', 'Wow, thats strikes me as being a bit busy.  I struggle determining where the subject really is.  The cart, or the man on the bike?  To me, they both compete for the scene.', '2008-02-15 18:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489478, 645926, 86848, '<td valign="top">Thats a different idea.  I like it.</td>', 'Thats a different idea.  I like it.', '2008-02-15 18:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489481, 645672, 86848, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colors and good focus.  Nice job.</td>', 'Nice bright colors and good focus.  Nice job.', '2008-02-15 18:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489484, 644374, 86848, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2008-02-15 18:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489489, 646429, 86848, '<td valign="top">Love the leg motion.</td>', 'Love the leg motion.', '2008-02-15 19:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489495, 645348, 86848, '<td valign="top">Now that looks like fun.  Good shot.</td>', 'Now that looks like fun.  Good shot.', '2008-02-15 19:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489499, 643812, 86848, '<td valign="top">Is that a light bright in the background?  ;)</td>', 'Is that a light bright in the background?  ;)', '2008-02-15 19:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489505, 644793, 86848, '<td valign="top">Its a little hard to determine what is going on. There is movement, but I''m not sure why, or what direction.</td>', 'Its a little hard to determine what is going on. There is movement, but I''m not sure why, or what direction.', '2008-02-15 19:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489506, 643642, 86848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but what to do with panning?  Not sure I understand.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but what to do with panning?  Not sure I understand.', '2008-02-15 19:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489508, 643615, 86848, '<td valign="top">Wow, motion almost to the point of abstract.  This is something that I might hang on a wall.  Interesting.</td>', 'Wow, motion almost to the point of abstract.  This is something that I might hang on a wall.  Interesting.', '2008-02-15 19:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489527, 644401, 86848, '<td valign="top">Wow, that had to be a hard shot to get.  Nice color and motion.</td>', 'Wow, that had to be a hard shot to get.  Nice color and motion.', '2008-02-15 19:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489529, 644791, 86848, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Good motion and focus.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Good motion and focus.', '2008-02-15 19:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489564, 646439, 89431, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting and all the warm colors in your photograph. The main focus is clearly the car and the detail and sharpness of it is really a perfect example of panning. Gives an obvious feeling of movement, good job!</td>', 'I really like the lighting and all the warm colors in your photograph. The main focus is clearly the car and the detail and sharpness of it is really a perfect example of panning. Gives an obvious feeling of movement, good job!', '2008-02-15 20:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489566, 645778, 89431, '<td valign="top">Really nice job cropping this picture, i like how your subject is upright and not the buildings or ground. The blandness and neutrality of your background colors really make you subject stand out.</td>', 'Really nice job cropping this picture, i like how your subject is upright and not the buildings or ground. The blandness and neutrality of your background colors really make you subject stand out.', '2008-02-15 20:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489569, 645891, 89431, '<td valign="top">I think there is a little too much negative space here, your subject kind of gets lost in all the blur.</td>', 'I think there is a little too much negative space here, your subject kind of gets lost in all the blur.', '2008-02-15 20:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489570, 646255, 89431, '<td valign="top">Really nice job it''s amazing you captured that many subjects with such sharp focus. The birds also create a good line that leads my eye all around the photograph.</td>', 'Really nice job it''s amazing you captured that many subjects with such sharp focus. The birds also create a good line that leads my eye all around the photograph.', '2008-02-15 20:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489572, 645919, 89431, '<td valign="top">I would like to know what I''m looking at and I do believe something in your photograph is supposed to be blurred and only one main thing in focus...</td>', 'I would like to know what I''m looking at and I do believe something in your photograph is supposed to be blurred and only one main thing in focus...', '2008-02-15 20:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489576, 645990, 89431, '<td valign="top">This would be an amazing photograph is something was in focus! The subject looks very interesting and it does create a feeling of movement. I like all the horizontal lines that add to that feeling of speed too.</td>', 'This would be an amazing photograph is something was in focus! The subject looks very interesting and it does create a feeling of movement. I like all the horizontal lines that add to that feeling of speed too.', '2008-02-15 20:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489579, 646284, 89431, '<td valign="top">This is a cute photo and an absolutely perfect example of panning. I love the contrast, values in your photo, and choice of black &amp; white.</td>', 'This is a cute photo and an absolutely perfect example of panning. I love the contrast, values in your photo, and choice of black & white.', '2008-02-15 20:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489587, 644014, 89431, '<td valign="top">I think you should have done a bit of dodging and burning on the track (unless it is really pitch black) and your background could have been a bit more blurred to create more of a feeling of speed. I do like the contrasting colors like neon green and orange that really grab my attention though.</td>', 'I think you should have done a bit of dodging and burning on the track (unless it is really pitch black) and your background could have been a bit more blurred to create more of a feeling of speed. I do like the contrasting colors like neon green and orange that really grab my attention though.', '2008-02-15 20:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489632, 644303, 89431, '<td valign="top">I think the emphasis should be more on the people, they arent very focused. I do like the movement and the photo is very well balanced</td>', 'I think the emphasis should be more on the people, they arent very focused. I do like the movement and the photo is very well balanced', '2008-02-15 20:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489640, 643978, 89431, '<td valign="top">Nice use of texture, it adds good contrast as does the contrast between the boy''s skin and his shirt. Your subject needed to be more in focus.</td>', 'Nice use of texture, it adds good contrast as does the contrast between the boy''s skin and his shirt. Your subject needed to be more in focus.', '2008-02-15 21:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489659, 646423, 83686, '<td valign="top">not enough background "speed" but not a bad photo</td>', 'not enough background "speed" but not a bad photo', '2008-02-15 21:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489660, 644363, 6519, '<td valign="top">LOL one of my favourites in this challenge..... the blur makes it look like she''s doing 50 mph on that thing! Nicely done.</td>', 'LOL one of my favourites in this challenge..... the blur makes it look like she''s doing 50 mph on that thing! Nicely done.', '2008-02-15 21:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489661, 645453, 83686, '<td valign="top">too dark to really get a good background effect</td>', 'too dark to really get a good background effect', '2008-02-15 21:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489664, 645445, 83686, '<td valign="top">need more contrast between subject and background</td>', 'need more contrast between subject and background', '2008-02-15 21:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489673, 646148, 83686, '<td valign="top">too blurrred</td>', 'too blurrred', '2008-02-15 21:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489676, 645994, 83686, '<td valign="top">no difference between subject and background</td>', 'no difference between subject and background', '2008-02-15 21:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489683, 644776, 83686, '<td valign="top">looks like bokeh</td>', 'looks like bokeh', '2008-02-15 21:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489686, 646379, 83686, '<td valign="top">no panning technique</td>', 'no panning technique', '2008-02-15 21:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489687, 643642, 83686, '<td valign="top">no panning technique</td>', 'no panning technique', '2008-02-15 21:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489690, 644014, 83686, '<td valign="top">I just don''t "feel" it</td>', 'I just don''t "feel" it', '2008-02-15 21:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489694, 646473, 83686, '<td valign="top">panning not long exposure........</td>', 'panning not long exposure........', '2008-02-15 21:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489709, 645548, 83686, '<td valign="top">not a bad photo but contrast could be better</td>', 'not a bad photo but contrast could be better', '2008-02-15 21:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489710, 645391, 83686, '<td valign="top">nice contrast between subject and background but subject does need to be better captured</td>', 'nice contrast between subject and background but subject does need to be better captured', '2008-02-15 21:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489712, 646322, 89431, '<td valign="top">The background could have been more blurred but i like the cropping and line you created.</td>', 'The background could have been more blurred but i like the cropping and line you created.', '2008-02-15 21:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489715, 643268, 89431, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you focused on the right thing, the man in the background is a lot more interesting than the veggies. But I do like the bright contrasting colors.</td>', 'I don''t think you focused on the right thing, the man in the background is a lot more interesting than the veggies. But I do like the bright contrasting colors.', '2008-02-15 21:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489716, 645994, 89431, '<td valign="top">I think this photo could have been a lot better from another angle. There is a lot of negative space and there so much you could do with this subject.</td>', 'I think this photo could have been a lot better from another angle. There is a lot of negative space and there so much you could do with this subject.', '2008-02-15 21:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489734, 645375, 89431, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like how you used the space in your frame and cropped it aysemmetrically. And I like how only the colors on the subject pop so there are no distractions.</td>', 'Very nice, I like how you used the space in your frame and cropped it aysemmetrically. And I like how only the colors on the subject pop so there are no distractions.', '2008-02-15 21:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489743, 646473, 89431, '<td valign="top">This is very interesting and I appreciate the abstract quality. My only complaint is all the negative space. The colors and lighting work well together.</td>', 'This is very interesting and I appreciate the abstract quality. My only complaint is all the negative space. The colors and lighting work well together.', '2008-02-15 21:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489748, 646347, 89431, '<td valign="top">I love how highly contrasted and saturated the colors are. The emphasis on the players is very clear and sharply focused.</td>', 'I love how highly contrasted and saturated the colors are. The emphasis on the players is very clear and sharply focused.', '2008-02-15 21:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489756, 645427, 89431, '<td valign="top">Something needs to be in focus here but the colors do look very vibrant and kind of give shape to some kind of subject...</td>', 'Something needs to be in focus here but the colors do look very vibrant and kind of give shape to some kind of subject...', '2008-02-15 21:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489763, 644363, 89431, '<td valign="top">This shot is hillarious and very well done. The colors are eye-catching and all the lines in the photo, (especially the two that make an arrow) create more of an illusion of speed. Good job!</td>', 'This shot is hillarious and very well done. The colors are eye-catching and all the lines in the photo, (especially the two that make an arrow) create more of an illusion of speed. Good job!', '2008-02-15 21:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489767, 646470, 89287, '<td valign="top">Very nice!<br/>Great color and composition!<br/>A top pick for me,Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice!Great color and composition!A top pick for me,Good luck.', '2008-02-15 21:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489772, 646429, 89431, '<td valign="top">This definitely creates an illusion of speed. Love the vibrant colors I just wish more emphasis was put on the girl by having her torso and face in focus.</td>', 'This definitely creates an illusion of speed. Love the vibrant colors I just wish more emphasis was put on the girl by having her torso and face in focus.', '2008-02-15 22:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489779, 643812, 89431, '<td valign="top">The title is a little corny but don''t worry i didnt mark down for that! I love the high contrast, not just between colors but between modern and the past. I like the texture in the wax and metal holder it is very distinct. Even the way the candle is sslightly slanted really adds to this photo.</td>', 'The title is a little corny but don''t worry i didnt mark down for that! I love the high contrast, not just between colors but between modern and the past. I like the texture in the wax and metal holder it is very distinct. Even the way the candle is sslightly slanted really adds to this photo.', '2008-02-15 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489783, 645835, 89431, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of black and white and all the values your photograph has. It''s a bit creepy but the detail is so sharp and the contrasting so perfectly done.</td>', 'I like the choice of black and white and all the values your photograph has. It''s a bit creepy but the detail is so sharp and the contrasting so perfectly done.', '2008-02-15 22:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489789, 646267, 89431, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the way this was cropped, it is too slanted and doesn''t add anything to the photograph. I do like how you were able to focus on one thing, even if it was centered. It looks like a regular snapshot to me, but the kid is adorable...</td>', 'I don''t like the way this was cropped, it is too slanted and doesn''t add anything to the photograph. I do like how you were able to focus on one thing, even if it was centered. It looks like a regular snapshot to me, but the kid is adorable...', '2008-02-15 22:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489794, 646372, 89431, '<td valign="top">The negative space in your photograph works really well and actually adds to the feeling of speed the biker must have been going to get the high. I also like how unbalanced this photo is, it''s not all boring and centered like alot of them are. The blue pants almost blend too much with the background though.</td>', 'The negative space in your photograph works really well and actually adds to the feeling of speed the biker must have been going to get the high. I also like how unbalanced this photo is, it''s not all boring and centered like alot of them are. The blue pants almost blend too much with the background though.', '2008-02-15 22:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490013, 646329, 21029, '<td valign="top">This works! I love the colors and the plane looks to be dead on focus!  Nice Pic!</td>', 'This works! I love the colors and the plane looks to be dead on focus!  Nice Pic!', '2008-02-16 00:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490092, 645891, 77643, '<td valign="top">nice i like the background colors!!!!</td>', 'nice i like the background colors!!!!', '2008-02-16 02:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490093, 646010, 77643, '<td valign="top">Oo WOW</td>', 'Oo WOW', '2008-02-16 02:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490115, 644363, 87968, '<td valign="top">Haha this photo made me laugh =)</td>', 'Haha this photo made me laugh =)', '2008-02-16 03:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490142, 644442, 83080, '<td valign="top">The subject is slightly soft for me and the sun''s reflection on the passenger window is distracting.  The motion blur is good and it seems like you tracked the car well.  I''m wondering if the softness of the car may  be from being slightly out of focus rather than just the motion.  Nice pan overall.</td>', 'The subject is slightly soft for me and the sun''s reflection on the passenger window is distracting.  The motion blur is good and it seems like you tracked the car well.  I''m wondering if the softness of the car may  be from being slightly out of focus rather than just the motion.  Nice pan overall.', '2008-02-16 05:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490143, 644379, 83080, '<td valign="top">The front of the snowmobile is fairly sharp.  Try following a riders'' head rather than the front of the snowmobile to sharpen and draw eyes to the rider.  I like the contrast and balance of the composition.</td>', 'The front of the snowmobile is fairly sharp.  Try following a riders'' head rather than the front of the snowmobile to sharpen and draw eyes to the rider.  I like the contrast and balance of the composition.', '2008-02-16 05:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490146, 644655, 83080, '<td valign="top">Nice lines.  Might be better not to cut off the wheels.  Zooming out would get the wheels and you could put the ground/red wall seperation around the upper third.</td>', 'Nice lines.  Might be better not to cut off the wheels.  Zooming out would get the wheels and you could put the ground/red wall seperation around the upper third.', '2008-02-16 05:31:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4490148, 646345, 83080, '<td valign="top">Just realized I scored too hastily on this the first time and need to bump it up.  I must have been distracted.<br/> <br/>The bird is good and sharp.  Great sense of motion both in the panned background and the wingtips.  I wonder if this would make an effective b/w shot...  Yup, just tried it out.  This looks fantastic in b/w (and really interesting oversaturated too).<br/> <br/>Good overall composition.</td>', 'Just realized I scored too hastily on this the first time and need to bump it up.  I must have been distracted. The bird is good and sharp.  Great sense of motion both in the panned background and the wingtips.  I wonder if this would make an effective b/w shot...  Yup, just tried it out.  This looks fantastic in b/w (and really interesting oversaturated too). Good overall composition.', '2008-02-16 05:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490150, 646470, 83080, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  I wish the cab were slightly sharper, though I appreciate the long shutter you used.  Great motion.</td>', 'Nice colors.  I wish the cab were slightly sharper, though I appreciate the long shutter you used.  Great motion.', '2008-02-16 05:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490151, 646124, 83080, '<td valign="top">The subject is very clear, however,I think a little longer shutter could have helped strengthen the sense of motion.</td>', 'The subject is very clear, however,I think a little longer shutter could have helped strengthen the sense of motion.', '2008-02-16 05:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490154, 645751, 83080, '<td valign="top">Very crisp image around the hands/handlebars.  Too bad his head is not more sharp, but this is really well done considering you used a fairly longer shutter compared to others.  Great sense of motion.</td>', 'Very crisp image around the hands/handlebars.  Too bad his head is not more sharp, but this is really well done considering you used a fairly longer shutter compared to others.  Great sense of motion.', '2008-02-16 05:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490155, 645437, 83080, '<td valign="top">Great job keeping the horse clear despite what looks like a significant shutter time.  A lower pov might have brought the line between background textures nicely to the upper third.  That line is a little distracting to me as it is.  Nice shot overall.</td>', 'Great job keeping the horse clear despite what looks like a significant shutter time.  A lower pov might have brought the line between background textures nicely to the upper third.  That line is a little distracting to me as it is.  Nice shot overall.', '2008-02-16 05:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490156, 646325, 83080, '<td valign="top">Great pov and nice job keeping the head sharp and managing the exposure.</td>', 'Great pov and nice job keeping the head sharp and managing the exposure.', '2008-02-16 06:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490157, 646296, 83080, '<td valign="top">Nice pan.  Her face is remarkably sharp.  I love all of the primary colors in this.</td>', 'Nice pan.  Her face is remarkably sharp.  I love all of the primary colors in this.', '2008-02-16 06:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490160, 645835, 83080, '<td valign="top">Fun shot.  It''s bit overexposed but it''s well composed.</td>', 'Fun shot.  It''s bit overexposed but it''s well composed.', '2008-02-16 06:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490162, 645911, 83080, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I like the composition although it would be nice if the "sun" was a little more sharp.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I like the composition although it would be nice if the "sun" was a little more sharp.', '2008-02-16 06:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490163, 646193, 83080, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  With the merry-go-round you probably could have gotten away with a longer shutter to accentuate the motion.  Still, the panning effect is very clear here.</td>', 'Cute shot.  With the merry-go-round you probably could have gotten away with a longer shutter to accentuate the motion.  Still, the panning effect is very clear here.', '2008-02-16 06:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490164, 646262, 83080, '<td valign="top">A bit underexposed and the background feels posterized.  It really lacks the feel of panning.  Nice clarity on the top of the wing.</td>', 'A bit underexposed and the background feels posterized.  It really lacks the feel of panning.  Nice clarity on the top of the wing.', '2008-02-16 06:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490166, 644014, 83080, '<td valign="top">The shutter here is fairly fast for feeling the speed.  There is slight motion on the background, but this could be much more effective if the exposure were long enough to allow the wheels/spokes to blur.</td>', 'The shutter here is fairly fast for feeling the speed.  There is slight motion on the background, but this could be much more effective if the exposure were long enough to allow the wheels/spokes to blur.', '2008-02-16 06:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490169, 645831, 83080, '<td valign="top">Whoah, he looks like he''s about to fall off the back.  It''s a bit overexposed and I would suggest trying a pov that puts the snowline closer to one of the thirds rather than down the middle.  Nice job keeping the rider sharp.</td>', 'Whoah, he looks like he''s about to fall off the back.  It''s a bit overexposed and I would suggest trying a pov that puts the snowline closer to one of the thirds rather than down the middle.  Nice job keeping the rider sharp.', '2008-02-16 06:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490170, 646253, 83080, '<td valign="top">Great converging lines really pulling my eye through the picture.  The lower line behind the razor is very strange.  Honestly, it makes it look like she is posing in front of a blurred backdrop to me.</td>', 'Great converging lines really pulling my eye through the picture.  The lower line behind the razor is very strange.  Honestly, it makes it look like she is posing in front of a blurred backdrop to me.', '2008-02-16 06:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490173, 646276, 83080, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but the subject is not particularly interesting to me.  Also, for such a strong verticle line, I would suggest orienting it closer to one of the lines of thirds.  Being just barely off center gives me an out of balance feel.</td>', 'Sorry, but the subject is not particularly interesting to me.  Also, for such a strong verticle line, I would suggest orienting it closer to one of the lines of thirds.  Being just barely off center gives me an out of balance feel.', '2008-02-16 06:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490174, 646441, 83080, '<td valign="top">With a night shot, you probably could have gotten away with a longer shutter to enhance the feeling of motion.</td>', 'With a night shot, you probably could have gotten away with a longer shutter to enhance the feeling of motion.', '2008-02-16 06:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490176, 646291, 83080, '<td valign="top">A longer shutter would give this a stronger sense of motion.  Try making it long enough to allow the car''s wheels to blur and it will have a more effective pan feel rather than just feeling blurry.</td>', 'A longer shutter would give this a stronger sense of motion.  Try making it long enough to allow the car''s wheels to blur and it will have a more effective pan feel rather than just feeling blurry.', '2008-02-16 06:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490178, 643918, 83080, '<td valign="top">There is not much background motion, so the subject actually looks fairly stationary to me.  Try a longer shutter.  A little overexposed, but I like the dragon''s colors.</td>', 'There is not much background motion, so the subject actually looks fairly stationary to me.  Try a longer shutter.  A little overexposed, but I like the dragon''s colors.', '2008-02-16 06:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490179, 646418, 83080, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  The panning effect is too minimal for me.  Try a longer shutter to enhanse the feeling of motion.</td>', 'Nice picture.  The panning effect is too minimal for me.  Try a longer shutter to enhanse the feeling of motion.', '2008-02-16 06:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490180, 645994, 83080, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  The panning effect is too subtle for me.  Try a longer shutter to accentuate the feeling of motion.</td>', 'Nice picture.  The panning effect is too subtle for me.  Try a longer shutter to accentuate the feeling of motion.', '2008-02-16 06:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
