(4490182, 644303, 83080, '<td valign="top">Fun picture.  The extra large top/bottom border is very distracting for me.  Good job tracking the subject.</td>', 'Fun picture.  The extra large top/bottom border is very distracting for me.  Good job tracking the subject.', '2008-02-16 06:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490183, 646439, 83080, '<td valign="top">Like the lines and car sharpness.  The extra wide top/bottom borders are distracting.</td>', 'Like the lines and car sharpness.  The extra wide top/bottom borders are distracting.', '2008-02-16 06:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490185, 645445, 83080, '<td valign="top">The panning effect is too subtle for me.  Try a longer shutter to accentuate the feeling of motion.  It would also help to have something in the background that shows motion better than clouds.</td>', 'The panning effect is too subtle for me.  Try a longer shutter to accentuate the feeling of motion.  It would also help to have something in the background that shows motion better than clouds.', '2008-02-16 06:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490186, 645391, 83080, '<td valign="top">Dramatic colors.  I wish the subject was a little more sharp.  Nice overall composition.</td>', 'Dramatic colors.  I wish the subject was a little more sharp.  Nice overall composition.', '2008-02-16 06:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490189, 645453, 83080, '<td valign="top">The panning effect is too subtle for me.  I think this needs more background elements to show the motion.  Love how you captured the flame.</td>', 'The panning effect is too subtle for me.  I think this needs more background elements to show the motion.  Love how you captured the flame.', '2008-02-16 06:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490190, 646473, 83080, '<td valign="top">Some people will say that this is not panning.  You just need to tell them that your subject (the bridge) is in motion and your camera tracked along with the bridge while a background car blurred by (it''s foreground, but hey, it''s all a matter of perspective).<br/> <br/>Seriously, I love the long exposure shots like this.  It doesn''t meet this challenge, but you might find an angle on this shot that would meet the leading lines challenge very well.</td>', 'Some people will say that this is not panning.  You just need to tell them that your subject (the bridge) is in motion and your camera tracked along with the bridge while a background car blurred by (it''s foreground, but hey, it''s all a matter of perspective). Seriously, I love the long exposure shots like this.  It doesn''t meet this challenge, but you might find an angle on this shot that would meet the leading lines challenge very well.', '2008-02-16 06:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490192, 645926, 83080, '<td valign="top">The panning effect is too subtle for me.  Try a longer shutter to accentuate the feeling of motion.</td>', 'The panning effect is too subtle for me.  Try a longer shutter to accentuate the feeling of motion.', '2008-02-16 06:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490194, 645990, 83080, '<td valign="top">Holy giant border Batman!  That''s a gigantic and distracting border.  I appreciate that you probably used a longer shutter than any other horse shot entered (and perhaps longer than 97% of all shots entered), still, the subject is too blurry for me.  On the other hand, this does have a nice impressionistic effect.</td>', 'Holy giant border Batman!  That''s a gigantic and distracting border.  I appreciate that you probably used a longer shutter than any other horse shot entered (and perhaps longer than 97% of all shots entered), still, the subject is too blurry for me.  On the other hand, this does have a nice impressionistic effect.', '2008-02-16 06:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490195, 644741, 83080, '<td valign="top">The panning effect is too subtle for me.  Try a longer shutter to accentuate the feeling of motion.  Ferry funny composition.  Love that the head is bobbling!</td>', 'The panning effect is too subtle for me.  Try a longer shutter to accentuate the feeling of motion.  Ferry funny composition.  Love that the head is bobbling!', '2008-02-16 06:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490196, 646347, 83080, '<td valign="top">Things are blurring but the panning motion is fairly weak.  I think you need a little longer shutter speed and it might help to zoom in on the action (which would also emphasize motion in the background).</td>', 'Things are blurring but the panning motion is fairly weak.  I think you need a little longer shutter speed and it might help to zoom in on the action (which would also emphasize motion in the background).', '2008-02-16 06:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490198, 644589, 83080, '<td valign="top">The panning effect is too subtle for me.  Try a longer shutter to accentuate the feeling of motion.  The background is very bright.  Consider a higher pov to cut out that sort of problem.  Good sharpness on the car.</td>', 'The panning effect is too subtle for me.  Try a longer shutter to accentuate the feeling of motion.  The background is very bright.  Consider a higher pov to cut out that sort of problem.  Good sharpness on the car.', '2008-02-16 06:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490203, 646348, 83080, '<td valign="top">The panning effect is too subtle for me(The background could be mistaken for strong bokeh).  Try a longer shutter to accentuate the feeling of motion.  The subject is not particularly interesting.  A different pov might help.</td>', 'The panning effect is too subtle for me(The background could be mistaken for strong bokeh).  Try a longer shutter to accentuate the feeling of motion.  The subject is not particularly interesting.  A different pov might help.', '2008-02-16 07:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490208, 646468, 83080, '<td valign="top">Grit indeed.  That''s one grainy shot.  The pan is evident, but the high level of "grit" muddles this shot up for me.</td>', 'Grit indeed.  That''s one grainy shot.  The pan is evident, but the high level of "grit" muddles this shot up for me.', '2008-02-16 07:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490209, 644628, 83080, '<td valign="top">The panning effect is too subtle for me.  Try a longer shutter to accentuate the feeling of motion.</td>', 'The panning effect is too subtle for me.  Try a longer shutter to accentuate the feeling of motion.', '2008-02-16 07:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
