(4490236, 644622, 83080, '<td valign="top">Pretty shapes and colors.  I don''t get the feeling of panning from this, but it''s certainly unique among the challenge entries.</td>', 'Pretty shapes and colors.  I don''t get the feeling of panning from this, but it''s certainly unique among the challenge entries.', '2008-02-16 07:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490239, 646304, 83080, '<td valign="top">I knew someone would be unable to resist the temptation to make this shot!  Long exposure, but I don''t think it qualifies as panning in the photographic sense.  Thanks for doing something fun.</td>', 'I knew someone would be unable to resist the temptation to make this shot!  Long exposure, but I don''t think it qualifies as panning in the photographic sense.  Thanks for doing something fun.', '2008-02-16 07:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490243, 643642, 83080, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the panning, unless you''re going to argue that you''re tracking these two boats with the motion of the Earth and the sun is blurring along in the background.  If that''s the case, this would have been more effective with stars and a long exposure night shot (and just a little lighting on the boats).  It is a nice picture.  I really like the overall composition.</td>', 'I don''t see the panning, unless you''re going to argue that you''re tracking these two boats with the motion of the Earth and the sun is blurring along in the background.  If that''s the case, this would have been more effective with stars and a long exposure night shot (and just a little lighting on the boats).  It is a nice picture.  I really like the overall composition.', '2008-02-16 07:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490247, 646458, 83080, '<td valign="top">There''s certainly motion blur going on and this composition works on some levels.  It would help for me if there were some element of the subject that was sharp.  Otherwise it looks like a shot where everyting is in motion rather than trying to track along with the subject.</td>', 'There''s certainly motion blur going on and this composition works on some levels.  It would help for me if there were some element of the subject that was sharp.  Otherwise it looks like a shot where everyting is in motion rather than trying to track along with the subject.', '2008-02-16 07:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490252, 645427, 83080, '<td valign="top">Happy new year!  And an abstract new year it is too!  If white is the subject of this shot, then you have followed it to perfection.  You are indeed panning, which is more than I can say for many other shots in this challenge.</td>', 'Happy new year!  And an abstract new year it is too!  If white is the subject of this shot, then you have followed it to perfection.  You are indeed panning, which is more than I can say for many other shots in this challenge.', '2008-02-16 07:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
