(4490418, 645720, 48389, '<td valign="top">These trains are much better than they used to be! Damian and I were forever moaning about the poor service but the last time I took a trip with them I was impressed! ;o) <br/> <br/>Now, is this my ''winged'' friend or another Yorkshire member? :o) Well done on getting some good detail in the train and for entering a shot that shows panning as it should be...after voting on over half of this challenge so far I can tell you that you are in the minority...you''d be surprised how many people have entered allsorts of weird and wonderful non panning shots in this challenge!<br/> <br/>Good luck :o)</td>', 'These trains are much better than they used to be! Damian and I were forever moaning about the poor service but the last time I took a trip with them I was impressed! ;o)  Now, is this my ''winged'' friend or another Yorkshire member? :o) Well done on getting some good detail in the train and for entering a shot that shows panning as it should be...after voting on over half of this challenge so far I can tell you that you are in the minority...you''d be surprised how many people have entered allsorts of weird and wonderful non panning shots in this challenge! Good luck :o)', '2008-02-16 10:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
