(4493856, 643615, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the array of colors and the panning is good. However, I don''t feel the centered composition work too well here. A subject like this needs to be shown with a more dynamic composition so the sense of flight come to life. My eyes should flow through the image and not get trapped in the center so something off centered would have been ideal here and maybe a more edgy crop/tilt to heighten the experience further.</td>', 'I like the array of colors and the panning is good. However, I don''t feel the centered composition work too well here. A subject like this needs to be shown with a more dynamic composition so the sense of flight come to life. My eyes should flow through the image and not get trapped in the center so something off centered would have been ideal here and maybe a more edgy crop/tilt to heighten the experience further.', '2008-02-18 05:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493859, 646267, 41337, '<td valign="top">The bright colors adds to the overall playfulness and the tilt brings it all together. Nicely done.</td>', 'The bright colors adds to the overall playfulness and the tilt brings it all together. Nicely done.', '2008-02-18 05:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
