(4496634, 645445, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is cool, and I know that it is very hard to get birds while they are in flight.  You definity have to pan them.  I think the image would have worked better if you could have added the panning in with a slower shutter speed.</td>', 'This is cool, and I know that it is very hard to get birds while they are in flight.  You definity have to pan them.  I think the image would have worked better if you could have added the panning in with a slower shutter speed.', '2008-02-19 01:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4496637, 644741, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is the definition of "running out of ideas".  With that said, you did pan and that was what the challenge called for.</td>', 'This is the definition of "running out of ideas".  With that said, you did pan and that was what the challenge called for.', '2008-02-19 01:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4496638, 644301, 59415, '<td valign="top">That Ferrari really handles well.</td>', 'That Ferrari really handles well.', '2008-02-19 01:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4496641, 645391, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice image.  Very good</td>', 'This is a really nice image.  Very good', '2008-02-19 01:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4496642, 644698, 59415, '<td valign="top">Not enough sense of motion to make this image exciting.  I know that you have to pan in order to get shots like these, but as a voter I was looking for the special effect of panning to create some sort of feeling of motion.</td>', 'Not enough sense of motion to make this image exciting.  I know that you have to pan in order to get shots like these, but as a voter I was looking for the special effect of panning to create some sort of feeling of motion.', '2008-02-19 01:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4496644, 643615, 59415, '<td valign="top">I like how you were able to stop the birds head.  That was some crafty camera work.</td>', 'I like how you were able to stop the birds head.  That was some crafty camera work.', '2008-02-19 01:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4496646, 645911, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think the Sun would have needed to be sharper in order to pull this image off.</td>', 'I think the Sun would have needed to be sharper in order to pull this image off.', '2008-02-19 01:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4496647, 646485, 59415, '<td valign="top">Very good job of keeping the bird so still.</td>', 'Very good job of keeping the bird so still.', '2008-02-19 01:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4496649, 645778, 59415, '<td valign="top">Very cool image, but I don''t like seeing the buildings crooked like that.</td>', 'Very cool image, but I don''t like seeing the buildings crooked like that.', '2008-02-19 01:26:21.000000', NULL, 1);
