(4497144, 646148, 66201, '<td valign="top">Okay - you''re probably going to get marked down because the body isn''t in crisp focus, but I think this is the best image of the whole bunch. I just love it''s powdery qualities and the general motion blur captures the flight and spirit beautifully. 9!!</td>', 'Okay - you''re probably going to get marked down because the body isn''t in crisp focus, but I think this is the best image of the whole bunch. I just love it''s powdery qualities and the general motion blur captures the flight and spirit beautifully. 9!!', '2008-02-19 09:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
