(4497169, 646284, 66201, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this is strictly "panning" because it looks as if the subject is on a merry-go-round, which would suggest that the subject is sitting/standing still in front of the camera which is held still, while the background scenery is spinning. Anyway, it''s a fun photo and it has great character.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this is strictly "panning" because it looks as if the subject is on a merry-go-round, which would suggest that the subject is sitting/standing still in front of the camera which is held still, while the background scenery is spinning. Anyway, it''s a fun photo and it has great character.', '2008-02-19 09:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4497170, 645919, 89422, '<td valign="top">The pattern in this picture is very attractive, and the colors really bring out the picture.</td>', 'The pattern in this picture is very attractive, and the colors really bring out the picture.', '2008-02-19 09:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
