(4499547, 645672, 41337, '<td valign="top">I remember when I was about a couple of ribbons behind you then you just took off. Congrats on the blue. This one got my highest vote.</td>', 'I remember when I was about a couple of ribbons behind you then you just took off. Congrats on the blue. This one got my highest vote.', '2008-02-20 00:29:43.000000', NULL, 0),
