(4499579, 645427, 66524, '<td valign="top">:)  wow, see how have impacted me!  You give me pause to look closer!  I am a better DPC voter now.</td>', ':)  wow, see how have impacted me!  You give me pause to look closer!  I am a better DPC voter now.', '2008-02-20 00:33:11.000000', NULL, 0),
