(4499591, 645672, 81301, '<td valign="top">Judi, congratulation on another ribbon - very well deserved.<br/>You are an extremely good and versatile photographer  you are always original and different.<br/>Very refreshing compare to all those one tricked dog kind of photographers that are around...<br/></td>', 'Judi, congratulation on another ribbon - very well deserved.You are an extremely good and versatile photographer  you are always original and different.Very refreshing compare to all those one tricked dog kind of photographers that are around...', '2008-02-20 00:35:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4499623, 646329, 46663, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot - where is PDX?  Looks like it could have been taken down the road from where I live - at Skyharbor PHX.  I love how you captured color in this shot too.  I didn''t get to vote in this one but it deserves the high score it received.</td>', 'Amazing shot - where is PDX?  Looks like it could have been taken down the road from where I live - at Skyharbor PHX.  I love how you captured color in this shot too.  I didn''t get to vote in this one but it deserves the high score it received.', '2008-02-20 00:40:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4499645, 646329, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp and great subject. Didn''t see this one in voting stage. Congrats on the RED</td>', 'Nice and sharp and great subject. Didn''t see this one in voting stage. Congrats on the RED', '2008-02-20 00:43:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4499668, 646010, 69008, '<td valign="top">Being patient paid off with this shot. Great capture of awesome subjects in motion. I think that the one running out of the image adds a bit of mystery about where they are going, and seems to infer that the run isn''t limited to the frame of the image.</td>', 'Being patient paid off with this shot. Great capture of awesome subjects in motion. I think that the one running out of the image adds a bit of mystery about where they are going, and seems to infer that the run isn''t limited to the frame of the image.', '2008-02-20 00:49:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4499696, 646025, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. Congrats on 4th place</td>', 'Great action shot. Congrats on 4th place', '2008-02-20 00:54:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4499699, 646253, 23430, '<td valign="top">Cute shot. Congrats on the Yellow ribbon.</td>', 'Cute shot. Congrats on the Yellow ribbon.', '2008-02-20 00:55:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4499710, 644374, 21569, '<td valign="top">Thanks for some of the comments. I had taken some F15''s that day but they did not convey a sense of speed. For those who may be interested here is the original shot <a href="//www.pbase.com/caeclyd/image/92639391" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.pbase.com/caeclyd/image/92639391</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-20 00:58:49.</i></td>', 'Thanks for some of the comments. I had taken some F15''s that day but they did not convey a sense of speed. For those who may be interested here is the original shot //www.pbase.com/caeclyd/image/92639391', '2008-02-20 00:58:10.000000', '2008-02-20 00:58:49.000000', 0),
(4499721, 645672, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great shot Judi. Well deserved BLUE. Congrats.</td>', 'Great shot Judi. Well deserved BLUE. Congrats.', '2008-02-20 01:02:20.000000', NULL, 0),
