(4499873, 646329, 4919, '<td valign="top">niceeeeeeeee.. I was thinking about the exact same location for this challenge but I dont think I could have got anything close to urs..but I should go there this weekend and try something ..... Love your picture again</td>', 'niceeeeeeeee.. I was thinking about the exact same location for this challenge but I dont think I could have got anything close to urs..but I should go there this weekend and try something ..... Love your picture again', '2008-02-20 02:56:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4499875, 645990, 82814, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for taking the time to comment.  This shot was more of an accident than it was intentional, but sometimes accidental captures are worth saving.  I didn''t realize that the size of the border would have so much impact on the voters, but I learned something important from those respondents who felt it was overpowering.</td>', 'Thank you all for taking the time to comment.  This shot was more of an accident than it was intentional, but sometimes accidental captures are worth saving.  I didn''t realize that the size of the border would have so much impact on the voters, but I learned something important from those respondents who felt it was overpowering.', '2008-02-20 02:58:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4499883, 645427, 48471, '<td valign="top">O man, I thougt it is Yun-Fat Chow doing some Kung Fu here... now I see it is the celebration of the New Year...<br/>This is good, much more interesting, good experiment.</td>', 'O man, I thougt it is Yun-Fat Chow doing some Kung Fu here... now I see it is the celebration of the New Year...This is good, much more interesting, good experiment.', '2008-02-20 03:08:24.000000', NULL, 0),
