(4499984, 645453, 30982, '<td valign="top">Aran is cute.  :-)  I''m guessing your score is based on the DNMC factor (based on comments).  Such is the way of DPC - I think it''s a great shot of Aran (he''s got an awesome smile) and I like how the lights behind are shining through his person.</td>', 'Aran is cute.  :-)  I''m guessing your score is based on the DNMC factor (based on comments).  Such is the way of DPC - I think it''s a great shot of Aran (he''s got an awesome smile) and I like how the lights behind are shining through his person.', '2008-02-20 05:26:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4500001, 644698, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that based on the comments, the voters didn''t see this as panning.  Tough challenge, tough crowd!  I think it''s well titled - really does look the one is chasing the other one out of its territory.</td>', 'I''m guessing that based on the comments, the voters didn''t see this as panning.  Tough challenge, tough crowd!  I think it''s well titled - really does look the one is chasing the other one out of its territory.', '2008-02-20 05:43:12.000000', NULL, 0),
