(4500266, 646329, 51793, '<td valign="top">hahha great shot man. You would think that he would be worried about landing/taking off rather than tying to see what you were doing?</td>', 'hahha great shot man. You would think that he would be worried about landing/taking off rather than tying to see what you were doing?', '2008-02-20 08:19:10.000000', NULL, 0),
