(4500336, 646145, 86799, '<td valign="top">It''s a simple table-top toy, a combination of pendulum and orbital motion, you''ve seen several I''m sure.  Attempts to pan the camera to maintain a spot of sharp definition produced O.K. images, but nothing really very interesting.  This one in patrticular, though the panning isn''t as evident, was by far the most intriguing and abstract.  No, it''s not a typical panning shot.  That''s O.K., I liked it, and a few of you voters did,too.<br/> <br/>Yes, it IS in focus.</td>', 'It''s a simple table-top toy, a combination of pendulum and orbital motion, you''ve seen several I''m sure.  Attempts to pan the camera to maintain a spot of sharp definition produced O.K. images, but nothing really very interesting.  This one in patrticular, though the panning isn''t as evident, was by far the most intriguing and abstract.  No, it''s not a typical panning shot.  That''s O.K., I liked it, and a few of you voters did,too. Yes, it IS in focus.', '2008-02-20 08:38:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4500338, 645919, 80904, '<td valign="top">I am very apalled that this didnt make it higher. This was one of the best shots IMO</td>', 'I am very apalled that this didnt make it higher. This was one of the best shots IMO', '2008-02-20 08:39:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4500493, 646148, 3569, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  I was tired doing panning of your typical motorcycles, bicycles, cars, runners, etc. or anything similar.<br/> <br/>So, I tried a motion blur pan, focusing on an atypical subject.  In this case the wing.  Slightly blurred on purpose.<br/> <br/>I knew it would do real well here, but what else is new.<br/> <br/>Van</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  I was tired doing panning of your typical motorcycles, bicycles, cars, runners, etc. or anything similar. So, I tried a motion blur pan, focusing on an atypical subject.  In this case the wing.  Slightly blurred on purpose. I knew it would do real well here, but what else is new. Van', '2008-02-20 09:42:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4500554, 645672, 40386, '<td valign="top">Judi you are my heroine!!!!  A <b>HORSE</b> picture with a Blue ribbon let alone in the top 10!!!!!<br/> <br/>Fabulous picture, well done.<br/></td>', 'Judi you are my heroine!!!!  A HORSE picture with a Blue ribbon let alone in the top 10!!!!! Fabulous picture, well done.', '2008-02-20 09:59:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4500558, 645919, 69008, '<td valign="top">You certainly made good use of a unique location to get this, and you knew how to get what you wanted from the scene.  Good image. <br/> <br/></td>', 'You certainly made good use of a unique location to get this, and you knew how to get what you wanted from the scene.  Good image.  ', '2008-02-20 10:00:06.000000', NULL, 0),
