(4506377, 644303, 50695, '<td valign="top">Though I have failed in the past :O this time I recognized Aimee. I like this shot. It has a great spirit of fun and affection to it, but is also exciting (which is what panning is all about). I think your lack of time to "focus on the setup" has made for a very candid, natural-looking shot, as though you just happened to come across a mother and child racing through the parking lot on a shopping cart. It''s quite effective.</td>', 'Though I have failed in the past :O this time I recognized Aimee. I like this shot. It has a great spirit of fun and affection to it, but is also exciting (which is what panning is all about). I think your lack of time to "focus on the setup" has made for a very candid, natural-looking shot, as though you just happened to come across a mother and child racing through the parking lot on a shopping cart. It''s quite effective.', '2008-02-22 06:50:02.000000', NULL, 0),
