(4510898, 646458, 61651, '<td valign="top">Cat abstraction in pen and ink - the directional motion blur alone should have clued people in that the camera was panned, which fits the challenge perfectly, but not the individual voter''s expectations of what "panned" is supposed to look like.  I''m with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a> on this one - this shot and "leaf chaser" would go on my wall.</td>', 'Cat abstraction in pen and ink - the directional motion blur alone should have clued people in that the camera was panned, which fits the challenge perfectly, but not the individual voter''s expectations of what "panned" is supposed to look like.  I''m with  Melethia on this one - this shot and "leaf chaser" would go on my wall.', '2008-02-23 21:42:17.000000', NULL, 0),
