(4511189, 646468, 53814, '<td valign="top">This is great, the grain creates the illusion that the biker is wearing a camouflage outfit and gas mask to escape the grit. Also, it reminds me of one of those "running but standing still" childhood dreams - the panning effect you achieved gives the feeling the bike is drafting backwards. You need to try harder than this if you want to finish last.</td>', 'This is great, the grain creates the illusion that the biker is wearing a camouflage outfit and gas mask to escape the grit. Also, it reminds me of one of those "running but standing still" childhood dreams - the panning effect you achieved gives the feeling the bike is drafting backwards. You need to try harder than this if you want to finish last.', '2008-02-24 00:20:49.000000', NULL, 0),
