(4514239, 645672, 50034, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Ms. Judi!  Magnificent animal!  Great shot!  :)<br/> <br/>My last foot race was run on a horsetrack in Florida...5K as I recall to benefit Breast Cancer Research (i.e. called "Race for The Cure".)  <br/> <br/>An amazing circumstance with excellent scenery, but hooo, Boy!  I am soooooo out-of-shape!  I posted a shot I took there in the last Minimal Edit Challenge I entered here...Sure gives a sense of accomplishment to do something great for others!  :)</td>', 'Congratulations, Ms. Judi!  Magnificent animal!  Great shot!  :) My last foot race was run on a horsetrack in Florida...5K as I recall to benefit Breast Cancer Research (i.e. called "Race for The Cure".)   An amazing circumstance with excellent scenery, but hooo, Boy!  I am soooooo out-of-shape!  I posted a shot I took there in the last Minimal Edit Challenge I entered here...Sure gives a sense of accomplishment to do something great for others!  :)', '2008-02-25 09:16:35.000000', NULL, 0),
