(4555259, 644303, 52992, '<td valign="top">This just gives me shivers, Tim.  It''s a great shot - lovely action, and it looks SO fun !<br/> <br/>But the shivers - a quick-moving shopping cart that my older son was in at the time is how he ended up with a broken tibia.  Something of a freak accident, but it''s left us all a little leery of shopping carts since.<br/> <br/>Looks like Aiden and Aimee had a blast though - hope everyone came out intact.</td>', 'This just gives me shivers, Tim.  It''s a great shot - lovely action, and it looks SO fun ! But the shivers - a quick-moving shopping cart that my older son was in at the time is how he ended up with a broken tibia.  Something of a freak accident, but it''s left us all a little leery of shopping carts since. Looks like Aiden and Aimee had a blast though - hope everyone came out intact.', '2008-03-11 15:23:43.000000', NULL, 0),
