(4622790, 646182, 56880, '<td valign="top">Sheesh, did the voters here want you to place a reflector board under the seagull to give some fill light?  This is a great panning shot.  The boat-like thing on the right is a little weird, but not that distracting.  The colors look a little flat; maybe a bump in saturation or a poke of the curves adjustment would make this picture pop more.</td>', 'Sheesh, did the voters here want you to place a reflector board under the seagull to give some fill light?  This is a great panning shot.  The boat-like thing on the right is a little weird, but not that distracting.  The colors look a little flat; maybe a bump in saturation or a poke of the curves adjustment would make this picture pop more.', '2008-04-08 01:34:01.000000', NULL, 0),
